(7128527, 1090610, 108580, '<td valign="top">Bold reverse composition. Like me I think you tend not to photograph for the DPC masses but rather as a Wildlife photographer; only to record the beauty of the animal and the serenity of the moment. Such work provides everlasting achievement and an unforgettable sense of accomplishment, unlike set-up conveyor belt photography. I''d have voted an 8 at least. (Team TPL2 Image, sadly no vote)</td>', 'Bold reverse composition. Like me I think you tend not to photograph for the DPC masses but rather as a Wildlife photographer; only to record the beauty of the animal and the serenity of the moment. Such work provides everlasting achievement and an unforgettable sense of accomplishment, unlike set-up conveyor belt photography. I''d have voted an 8 at least. (Team TPL2 Image, sadly no vote)', '2013-11-12 04:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7128561, 1091153, 108069, '<td valign="top">Really cool design. Mix of light and shadow and paint and texture and angles and shapes organic and inorganic. Very cool.</td>', 'Really cool design. Mix of light and shadow and paint and texture and angles and shapes organic and inorganic. Very cool.', '2013-11-12 08:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
