(7130788, 1091451, 50695, '<td valign="top">going for an allegorical/conceptual spin, making the negative space part of the photo. she looks at it through her magnifying glass. Or is it a looking glass?</td>', 'going for an allegorical/conceptual spin, making the negative space part of the photo. she looks at it through her magnifying glass. Or is it a looking glass?', '2013-11-16 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
