(7130790, 1091477, 50695, '<td valign="top">you do create a sense of negative space by allowing the fishing pole to go all the way to the edge of the water.</td>', 'you do create a sense of negative space by allowing the fishing pole to go all the way to the edge of the water.', '2013-11-16 18:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130791, 1091348, 50695, '<td valign="top">oppressed by the negative space above him, it becomes a symbol of his overpowering depression. a little obvious for my taste, but I do like the lighting on the model, and his expression.</td>', 'oppressed by the negative space above him, it becomes a symbol of his overpowering depression. a little obvious for my taste, but I do like the lighting on the model, and his expression.', '2013-11-16 18:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130792, 1091482, 50695, '<td valign="top">not much illumination going on. negative space wins this round.</td>', 'not much illumination going on. negative space wins this round.', '2013-11-16 18:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130793, 1090940, 50695, '<td valign="top">you''ve lessened the impact of the negative space by lighting up part of it.</td>', 'you''ve lessened the impact of the negative space by lighting up part of it.', '2013-11-16 18:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130794, 1091481, 50695, '<td valign="top">the shape of an oak leaf does allow for some interest in the negative space, although you''ve made it so small that it lessens the impact.</td>', 'the shape of an oak leaf does allow for some interest in the negative space, although you''ve made it so small that it lessens the impact.', '2013-11-16 18:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130796, 1091167, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much of interest happening in the negative space, but you certainly do have a lot of it.</td>', 'I don''t see much of interest happening in the negative space, but you certainly do have a lot of it.', '2013-11-16 18:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130797, 1091109, 50695, '<td valign="top">yes you do create interesting layers of negative space.</td>', 'yes you do create interesting layers of negative space.', '2013-11-16 18:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130798, 1090294, 50695, '<td valign="top">yes, cutting your way into the negative space, in several directions, makes for a good example of the concept.</td>', 'yes, cutting your way into the negative space, in several directions, makes for a good example of the concept.', '2013-11-16 18:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130799, 1090610, 50695, '<td valign="top">all the interesting negative space is in the left half of the picture, made by the buck''s antlers, etc.</td>', 'all the interesting negative space is in the left half of the picture, made by the buck''s antlers, etc.', '2013-11-16 18:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130800, 1091392, 50695, '<td valign="top">the serene shapes in the middle of this image create a comforting negative space.</td>', 'the serene shapes in the middle of this image create a comforting negative space.', '2013-11-16 18:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130802, 1091387, 50695, '<td valign="top">for me, this illustrates the concept of putting the action at the edge, rather than the concept of negative space. Fortunately, I really like that concept, and you do it well here. there is indeed some interesting negative space in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'for me, this illustrates the concept of putting the action at the edge, rather than the concept of negative space. Fortunately, I really like that concept, and you do it well here. there is indeed some interesting negative space in the bottom right corner.', '2013-11-16 18:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130803, 1090626, 50695, '<td valign="top">by squashing your squarish subject into the corner, you create a rather dull expanse of negative space.</td>', 'by squashing your squarish subject into the corner, you create a rather dull expanse of negative space.', '2013-11-16 18:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130804, 1091409, 50695, '<td valign="top">the symmetry of a reflection can often be dull, compounded by a huge black space around it. this is not an effective use of negative space.</td>', 'the symmetry of a reflection can often be dull, compounded by a huge black space around it. this is not an effective use of negative space.', '2013-11-16 18:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130805, 1091264, 50695, '<td valign="top">some interesting shapes of negative space are created by the shape of the boat, peppered by gulls.</td>', 'some interesting shapes of negative space are created by the shape of the boat, peppered by gulls.', '2013-11-16 18:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130806, 1091155, 50695, '<td valign="top">the frog cuts into the negative space in interesting ways. his placement in the composition is a bit low-energy, though.</td>', 'the frog cuts into the negative space in interesting ways. his placement in the composition is a bit low-energy, though.', '2013-11-16 18:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130807, 1091169, 50695, '<td valign="top">the interest of the negative space would have been more apparent if you had cut off the right half of the photo.</td>', 'the interest of the negative space would have been more apparent if you had cut off the right half of the photo.', '2013-11-16 18:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130808, 1091374, 50695, '<td valign="top">the interest of the negative space would have been more apparent if you had cut off the right half of the photo. that big lump of space minimizes the impact of what''s going on in the left of the photo.</td>', 'the interest of the negative space would have been more apparent if you had cut off the right half of the photo. that big lump of space minimizes the impact of what''s going on in the left of the photo.', '2013-11-16 18:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130809, 1091079, 50695, '<td valign="top">the transparent vase and strong shadows blend into the background, creating very little sense of negative space. To have a negative you need a positive.</td>', 'the transparent vase and strong shadows blend into the background, creating very little sense of negative space. To have a negative you need a positive.', '2013-11-16 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130810, 1091435, 50695, '<td valign="top">the subject has a rather simple upside-down bell shape, uncomfortable close to the top of the frame. interesting negative space is not being created.</td>', 'the subject has a rather simple upside-down bell shape, uncomfortable close to the top of the frame. interesting negative space is not being created.', '2013-11-16 18:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130812, 1091322, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and color. the negative space is somewhat interesting in it''s backward C shape.</td>', 'I like the texture and color. the negative space is somewhat interesting in it''s backward C shape.', '2013-11-16 18:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130814, 1091383, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the way the dark patches of cloud complicate the negative space.</td>', 'I like the way the dark patches of cloud complicate the negative space.', '2013-11-16 18:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130819, 1091206, 50695, '<td valign="top">I see no interesting negative space or shapes of negative space. be careful with reflections. symmetry can be boring. it''s a good instinct to spill some water on the reflective surface. take that instinct further.</td>', 'I see no interesting negative space or shapes of negative space. be careful with reflections. symmetry can be boring. it''s a good instinct to spill some water on the reflective surface. take that instinct further.', '2013-11-16 18:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130843, 1090743, 146356, '<td valign="top">haha only folks who''ve been there or are from that region of the world are gonna get it - but --- wait a sec they allow photography in there?!</td>', 'haha only folks who''ve been there or are from that region of the world are gonna get it - but --- wait a sec they allow photography in there?!', '2013-11-16 19:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130874, 1091081, 50695, '<td valign="top">glitters are nice but the boat is so small it doesn''t make much interesting negative space.</td>', 'glitters are nice but the boat is so small it doesn''t make much interesting negative space.', '2013-11-16 21:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130875, 1091197, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how white this is while still making me feel like I can see every cloud. the clouds are positive and negative at once.</td>', 'I like how white this is while still making me feel like I can see every cloud. the clouds are positive and negative at once.', '2013-11-16 21:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130876, 1091441, 50695, '<td valign="top">you can make good use of negative space without causing imbalance in the composition. It''s about quality, not quantity.</td>', 'you can make good use of negative space without causing imbalance in the composition. It''s about quality, not quantity.', '2013-11-16 21:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130877, 1090928, 50695, '<td valign="top">for me, what saves this photo is the wonderful textures and colors and shapes in the rock face. it''s like waves of negative space.</td>', 'for me, what saves this photo is the wonderful textures and colors and shapes in the rock face. it''s like waves of negative space.', '2013-11-16 21:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130878, 1091443, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful waves of light on the waves of water. The stick protruding is our visual anchor. By being there, it makes everything else "negative space"</td>', 'beautiful waves of light on the waves of water. The stick protruding is our visual anchor. By being there, it makes everything else "negative space"', '2013-11-16 21:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130880, 1091352, 50695, '<td valign="top">good negative and positive shapes. the composition is just off balance enough to give it some energy. the light on the water is crucial to holding the composition together.</td>', 'good negative and positive shapes. the composition is just off balance enough to give it some energy. the light on the water is crucial to holding the composition together.', '2013-11-16 21:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130881, 1091385, 50695, '<td valign="top">yes. this does use negative space to make a point about isolation. I find the point a bit overbearing, but the photo does have nice texture.</td>', 'yes. this does use negative space to make a point about isolation. I find the point a bit overbearing, but the photo does have nice texture.', '2013-11-16 21:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130882, 1091275, 50695, '<td valign="top">the stump has interesting negative space. the rest is just drama.</td>', 'the stump has interesting negative space. the rest is just drama.', '2013-11-16 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130884, 1091157, 50695, '<td valign="top">a circle near the center of the image does not make interesting negative space.</td>', 'a circle near the center of the image does not make interesting negative space.', '2013-11-16 21:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130885, 1091313, 50695, '<td valign="top">good colorful bokeh in your negative space. I like the slight asymmetry of the hands.</td>', 'good colorful bokeh in your negative space. I like the slight asymmetry of the hands.', '2013-11-16 21:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130886, 1091200, 50695, '<td valign="top">a little too much negative space for me. Beautiful dog, though. The way this dog fades into the background is quite interesting, and getting in closer to the dog would have highlighted that.</td>', 'a little too much negative space for me. Beautiful dog, though. The way this dog fades into the background is quite interesting, and getting in closer to the dog would have highlighted that.', '2013-11-16 22:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130888, 1090463, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors. a reflection of positive space in your negative space also creates a reflection of negative space in your negative space. It sounds complex but it happens all the time when photographing water. The important thing is that you have a beautiful composition of lines and shapes and layers of space.</td>', 'beautiful colors. a reflection of positive space in your negative space also creates a reflection of negative space in your negative space. It sounds complex but it happens all the time when photographing water. The important thing is that you have a beautiful composition of lines and shapes and layers of space.', '2013-11-16 22:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130889, 1091277, 50695, '<td valign="top">the title is very evocative, and plays well with the disorienting nature of the photo. which way is up? does it matter? the negative space here is three-dimensional.</td>', 'the title is very evocative, and plays well with the disorienting nature of the photo. which way is up? does it matter? the negative space here is three-dimensional.', '2013-11-16 22:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130890, 1091393, 50695, '<td valign="top">a subtle amount of negative space compared to some others. I like the way the negative space creeps under his hood.</td>', 'a subtle amount of negative space compared to some others. I like the way the negative space creeps under his hood.', '2013-11-16 22:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130891, 1091124, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of beer commercials, but you fulfill the challenge well. Layers of negative space reach back.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of beer commercials, but you fulfill the challenge well. Layers of negative space reach back.', '2013-11-16 22:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130892, 1091164, 50695, '<td valign="top">spider and web cut into the negative space, one with black the other with white. good composition.</td>', 'spider and web cut into the negative space, one with black the other with white. good composition.', '2013-11-16 22:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130893, 1091048, 50695, '<td valign="top">better than most sky shots in this challenge because the cloud cuts into the negative space and breaks it up, creating interest.</td>', 'better than most sky shots in this challenge because the cloud cuts into the negative space and breaks it up, creating interest.', '2013-11-16 22:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130894, 1091400, 50695, '<td valign="top">cloud textures add some interest to your negative space.</td>', 'cloud textures add some interest to your negative space.', '2013-11-16 22:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130895, 1091199, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the odriew light in this. The negative space is so extreme in this I have to admit it creates some interest just by being so massive, and dwarfing the city.</td>', 'I like the odriew light in this. The negative space is so extreme in this I have to admit it creates some interest just by being so massive, and dwarfing the city.', '2013-11-16 22:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130896, 1091315, 50695, '<td valign="top">close but too little is happening to too little of a square to create interesting negative space.</td>', 'close but too little is happening to too little of a square to create interesting negative space.', '2013-11-16 22:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130897, 1091389, 50695, '<td valign="top">folds of fabric are lovely, as painters through the ages have known. They help this otherwise low energy photo.</td>', 'folds of fabric are lovely, as painters through the ages have known. They help this otherwise low energy photo.', '2013-11-16 22:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130900, 1091115, 50695, '<td valign="top">the bug capture is skillful. the negative space is okay, not terribly interesting.</td>', 'the bug capture is skillful. the negative space is okay, not terribly interesting.', '2013-11-16 22:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130901, 1091222, 50695, '<td valign="top">yes, this breaks up the negative space in a way that technically fulfills the challenge.</td>', 'yes, this breaks up the negative space in a way that technically fulfills the challenge.', '2013-11-16 22:13:56.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7130902, 1091444, 50695, '<td valign="top">you''ve squished the negative space into the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'you''ve squished the negative space into the bottom of the photo.', '2013-11-16 22:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130905, 1090970, 50695, '<td valign="top">good fulfillment of the challenge. slash apart that negative space!</td>', 'good fulfillment of the challenge. slash apart that negative space!', '2013-11-16 22:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130906, 1090634, 50695, '<td valign="top">what is negative and what is positive? here''s a button. press it to see.</td>', 'what is negative and what is positive? here''s a button. press it to see.', '2013-11-16 22:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130907, 1090743, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s all about the shadows, which you have cornered.</td>', 'it''s all about the shadows, which you have cornered.', '2013-11-16 22:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130908, 1091003, 50695, '<td valign="top">good fulfillment of challenge. lovely patterns of negative and positive space.</td>', 'good fulfillment of challenge. lovely patterns of negative and positive space.', '2013-11-16 22:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130909, 1091232, 50695, '<td valign="top">he looks like he''s stuck in the mud of your negative space.</td>', 'he looks like he''s stuck in the mud of your negative space.', '2013-11-16 22:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130910, 1091466, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is like Dr. Seuss. Fascinating birds and branches, and lovely clouds allow you to get away with this composition.</td>', 'this is like Dr. Seuss. Fascinating birds and branches, and lovely clouds allow you to get away with this composition.', '2013-11-16 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130912, 1091215, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful shapes of negative space in your clouds.</td>', 'beautiful shapes of negative space in your clouds.', '2013-11-16 22:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130913, 1091201, 50695, '<td valign="top">this little Mondrian has space competing to be positive and negative. Interesting composition. Well done.</td>', 'this little Mondrian has space competing to be positive and negative. Interesting composition. Well done.', '2013-11-16 22:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130914, 1091152, 50695, '<td valign="top">great stretch, great smile. the negative space is here to remind us of just how extreme this position is.</td>', 'great stretch, great smile. the negative space is here to remind us of just how extreme this position is.', '2013-11-16 22:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130915, 1091410, 50695, '<td valign="top">ominous negative space. cinematic, even.</td>', 'ominous negative space. cinematic, even.', '2013-11-16 22:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130916, 1090802, 50695, '<td valign="top">very pretty bokeh in your negative space.</td>', 'very pretty bokeh in your negative space.', '2013-11-16 22:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130917, 1091446, 50695, '<td valign="top">the processing is so extreme and confident that I trust you are making the correct composition, though it strikes me as a little unbalanced. the challenge is definitely fulfilled with beautiful struggle of shadow and light over who is positive and who is negative.</td>', 'the processing is so extreme and confident that I trust you are making the correct composition, though it strikes me as a little unbalanced. the challenge is definitely fulfilled with beautiful struggle of shadow and light over who is positive and who is negative.', '2013-11-16 22:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130918, 1091399, 50695, '<td valign="top">wonderful texture and light in your negative space.</td>', 'wonderful texture and light in your negative space.', '2013-11-16 22:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130921, 1091004, 50695, '<td valign="top">your negative space is a might wind. technically this fulfills your challenge since the negative space blows and thus creates an impact on the windmill of positive space. If one were a fan of windmills, one would like this photo.</td>', 'your negative space is a might wind. technically this fulfills your challenge since the negative space blows and thus creates an impact on the windmill of positive space. If one were a fan of windmills, one would like this photo.', '2013-11-16 22:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130922, 1091196, 50695, '<td valign="top">not an interesting shape of negative space, just an unbalanced composition. moon lonely.</td>', 'not an interesting shape of negative space, just an unbalanced composition. moon lonely.', '2013-11-16 22:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130923, 1091440, 50695, '<td valign="top">you found an example of negative space on an iPhone and took a photo of it. Congratulations, you can now meet any challenge with Google.</td>', 'you found an example of negative space on an iPhone and took a photo of it. Congratulations, you can now meet any challenge with Google.', '2013-11-16 22:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130924, 1091388, 50695, '<td valign="top">the tree does create interesting negative space with all its branches. Perhaps if you cropped it closer.</td>', 'the tree does create interesting negative space with all its branches. Perhaps if you cropped it closer.', '2013-11-16 22:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130925, 1091431, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the blue coming through the glass, the way it contrasts with the orange. you suggest a larger world outside the bowl that he can dream of but not achieve. so this is your theme of negative space as a dream, or a dream as negative space.</td>', 'I like the blue coming through the glass, the way it contrasts with the orange. you suggest a larger world outside the bowl that he can dream of but not achieve. so this is your theme of negative space as a dream, or a dream as negative space.', '2013-11-16 22:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130929, 1091260, 50695, '<td valign="top">the look like valves, valves for negative space to pass through.</td>', 'the look like valves, valves for negative space to pass through.', '2013-11-16 22:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130930, 1090692, 50695, '<td valign="top">keeping the bottom of the photo was a very good decision. it brings the rest of it to life somehow. I feel like a curtain is opening into negative space.</td>', 'keeping the bottom of the photo was a very good decision. it brings the rest of it to life somehow. I feel like a curtain is opening into negative space.', '2013-11-16 22:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130931, 1091478, 50695, '<td valign="top">real and painted space and negative space. this fulfills the challenge.</td>', 'real and painted space and negative space. this fulfills the challenge.', '2013-11-16 22:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130932, 1090996, 50695, '<td valign="top">negative space is stamped with squares. organic shapes cut into it. there is at least some textural interest here.</td>', 'negative space is stamped with squares. organic shapes cut into it. there is at least some textural interest here.', '2013-11-16 22:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130933, 1090579, 50695, '<td valign="top">a double meaning of negative space. not many have ventured into this sort of punning for the challenge, so I commend you for doing so. I also like how the boy has made himself almost unrecognizable as a human figure by holding his face. The woman is not conveying the story, though. Her eyes are too loving. But if you had conveyed the story too perfectly, it would have been dull. So, well done for using negative space in two ways at once, and keeping my interest.</td>', 'a double meaning of negative space. not many have ventured into this sort of punning for the challenge, so I commend you for doing so. I also like how the boy has made himself almost unrecognizable as a human figure by holding his face. The woman is not conveying the story, though. Her eyes are too loving. But if you had conveyed the story too perfectly, it would have been dull. So, well done for using negative space in two ways at once, and keeping my interest.', '2013-11-16 22:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130934, 1091298, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how the negative space has so much going on. Most people thought negative space had to be empty.</td>', 'I like how the negative space has so much going on. Most people thought negative space had to be empty.', '2013-11-16 22:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130935, 1091187, 50695, '<td valign="top">elegant little melody of negative space.</td>', 'elegant little melody of negative space.', '2013-11-16 22:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130936, 1091437, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how this fades into light, like color rinsing out of clothes. the lines of branches define the negative space around it. lovely.</td>', 'I like how this fades into light, like color rinsing out of clothes. the lines of branches define the negative space around it. lovely.', '2013-11-16 22:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130937, 1091175, 50695, '<td valign="top">a strong diagonal of positive space cutting into negative space makes for a good composition.</td>', 'a strong diagonal of positive space cutting into negative space makes for a good composition.', '2013-11-16 22:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130938, 1090993, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the subtlety of this. your subject looks like just another spot interrupting the negative space. Boldly subtle.</td>', 'I like the subtlety of this. your subject looks like just another spot interrupting the negative space. Boldly subtle.', '2013-11-16 22:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7130939, 1091463, 50695, '<td valign="top">You''ve taken a bad idea to such an extreme that it becomes a good idea. Indeed, I am lost in space.</td>', 'You''ve taken a bad idea to such an extreme that it becomes a good idea. Indeed, I am lost in space.', '2013-11-16 22:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
