(7131133, 1091206, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that should get a very high score bases on technical expertise, which is what is required for product photography like this. Very well done. As far as personal appeal, I love the colors and everything is spot on, but hey, it''s a photo of a watch and you''ve given this as much wow factor as you possibly can. A 6 only because the subject doesn''t do anything for me. (BTW, that''s not a criticism. I''ve done product photography of copiers, which is something with less mass appeal than almost anything else!)</td>', 'This is one of those shots that should get a very high score bases on technical expertise, which is what is required for product photography like this. Very well done. As far as personal appeal, I love the colors and everything is spot on, but hey, it''s a photo of a watch and you''ve given this as much wow factor as you possibly can. A 6 only because the subject doesn''t do anything for me. (BTW, that''s not a criticism. I''ve done product photography of copiers, which is something with less mass appeal than almost anything else!)', '2013-11-17 18:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
