(7131285, 1091357, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful brutal battle of negative spaces.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'beautiful brutal battle of negative spaces.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2013-11-17 21:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131286, 1091236, 50695, '<td valign="top">the dime resting in positive space, the moon resting in negative space. A hand defines the sky as negative. this photo is a poem.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'the dime resting in positive space, the moon resting in negative space. A hand defines the sky as negative. this photo is a poem.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2013-11-17 21:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131287, 1090887, 50695, '<td valign="top">big blurry negative space creates an interest in the small piece that''s left. I don''t know how you were able to succeed where so many have failed. Maybe it''p just the glow, the blur, of magic.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'big blurry negative space creates an interest in the small piece that''s left. I don''t know how you were able to succeed where so many have failed. Maybe it''p just the glow, the blur, of magic.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2013-11-17 21:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131288, 1091034, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful light on those cows! I like how the clouds invade along with them. For some reason I imagine them both travelling at the same slow inevitable pace. Together, they invade and thus create the negative space.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'beautiful light on those cows! I like how the clouds invade along with them. For some reason I imagine them both travelling at the same slow inevitable pace. Together, they invade and thus create the negative space.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2013-11-17 21:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131289, 1090899, 50695, '<td valign="top">the sky might be thought of as negative space. or it''s almost as easy to think of the sea as negative space. your title suggests the entire photo is negative space. and even the negative sea is wiped out further by the long exposure blurring it. This is like reality with an eraser rubbed on it a few times... blurring the details but enhancing the color and feeling.</td>', 'the sky might be thought of as negative space. or it''s almost as easy to think of the sea as negative space. your title suggests the entire photo is negative space. and even the negative sea is wiped out further by the long exposure blurring it. This is like reality with an eraser rubbed on it a few times... blurring the details but enhancing the color and feeling.', '2013-11-17 21:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131290, 1091428, 50695, '<td valign="top">this actually has layers of negative space, and thus addresses the relativity of a concept like "negative" ... what is negative and what is positive? Is the wood absence of leaves? But the wood itself has gaps.</td>', 'this actually has layers of negative space, and thus addresses the relativity of a concept like "negative" ... what is negative and what is positive? Is the wood absence of leaves? But the wood itself has gaps.', '2013-11-17 21:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131292, 1091421, 50695, '<td valign="top">This certainly has a graceful shape of negative space, but also the colors feel as if they are negatives, even though they roughly correspond to leaves and sky. So you evoke negative on several levels, in a subtle way.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This certainly has a graceful shape of negative space, but also the colors feel as if they are negatives, even though they roughly correspond to leaves and sky. So you evoke negative on several levels, in a subtle way.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2013-11-17 21:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131294, 1090951, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like this micro-expression of despair or horror. the photo is mysterious, and dripping with negative space. anything positive is threatened with extinction.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I like this micro-expression of despair or horror. the photo is mysterious, and dripping with negative space. anything positive is threatened with extinction.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2013-11-17 21:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131295, 1091381, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the fuzziness of his net and how it corresponds to the texture of the waves and rocks. your "negative space" is the real subject here, and it''s lovely. ah, but that was too quick of me. The net thrower is also your subject... we wonder about him, about the textures of his thought.</td>', 'I love the fuzziness of his net and how it corresponds to the texture of the waves and rocks. your "negative space" is the real subject here, and it''s lovely. ah, but that was too quick of me. The net thrower is also your subject... we wonder about him, about the textures of his thought.', '2013-11-17 21:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7131296, 1091475, 50695, '<td valign="top">your overexposure/processing turns a cluttered scene into a world of negative space. the blurry figure interacting with this electric negativity fascinates me.<br/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'your overexposure/processing turns a cluttered scene into a world of negative space. the blurry figure interacting with this electric negativity fascinates me.  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2013-11-17 21:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
