(7131817, 1091475, 54645, '<td valign="top">Thanks folks, I was trying to generate a sense of negative space despite a photographically cluttered scene. It certainly is overwhelming when viewed from out here. Considered in the context of negative space (contrasting elements) she struck me as peacefully and actively embracing the surrounding stimuli over the 5 second exposure. My favorite aspect of this image is the sheltering tree "guiding" her further along despite the lack of a path.</td>', 'Thanks folks, I was trying to generate a sense of negative space despite a photographically cluttered scene. It certainly is overwhelming when viewed from out here. Considered in the context of negative space (contrasting elements) she struck me as peacefully and actively embracing the surrounding stimuli over the 5 second exposure. My favorite aspect of this image is the sheltering tree "guiding" her further along despite the lack of a path.', '2013-11-18 16:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
